================================================================================
LICENSE STRUCTURE
================================================================================

This repository uses a three-license structure reflecting biblical stewardship:
generous teaching of patterns, faithful protection of implementations.

1. PATTERNS LICENSE (Free)
   Location: tov/licenses/patterns/LICENSE.txt
   Covers: Patterns, principles, frameworks, methodologies
   Terms: Freely use, adapt, and apply with attribution
   Scripture: "Freely ye have received, freely give." - Matthew 10:8

2. IMPLEMENTATION LICENSE (Proprietary)
   Location: tov/licenses/implementation/LICENSE.txt
   Covers: Source code, binaries, specific implementations
   Terms: View and study only; commercial use requires permission
   Scripture: "Required in stewards to be found faithful." - 1 Corinthians 4:2

3. COMMERCIAL LICENSE (Revenue Share)
   Location: tov/licenses/commercial/LICENSE.txt
   Covers: Business rights to use Kingdom Technology products
   Terms: Revenue share model (0-20% based on success tier)
   Scripture: "The laborer is worthy of his wages." - Luke 10:7

