QUICK REFERENCE
================================================================================

| What You Want To Do                  | License Needed      |
|--------------------------------------|---------------------|
| Learn from patterns and principles   | Patterns (free)     |
| Study source code for education      | Implementation      |
| Use patterns in your own projects    | Patterns (free)     |
| Use our code in commercial products  | Commercial          |
| Teach our methodologies              | Patterns (free)     |
| Bundle/resell our products           | Commercial + OEM    |

